{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_image_pipeline", "label": "Image pipeline (custom Cloudinary loader)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Next's optimizer downloaded full originals from Cloudinary, re-encoded with sharp, and blew past its 7s fetch timeout on slow connections; every image 500'd. Cloudinary already resizes at the edge, so a custom loader rewrites every next/image src to a Cloudinary delivery URL and the /_next/image optimizer is bypassed."}, {"id": "claude_cloudinary_image_loader", "label": "cloudinary-image-loader.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_animation_stack", "label": "Animation stack (Lenis/GSAP/Three.js)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_design_direction", "label": "Design direction \u2014 the standard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Match the creative/technical level of aikawakenichi.com, ten.375.studio, igloo.inc: page transitions use the actual photos/videos of each page as animation material; the work IS the design. No generic overlays, no scroll-jacking, no decorative gradients."}, {"id": "claude_no_scroll_jacking", "label": "No scroll-jacking rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hussain: 'the lock is ruining the user experience.' Rejected on the photography Horizontal view (D3) and removed from the testimonials section (S6). Never pin scroll, hijack the wheel, or take over scroll position."}, {"id": "claude_grain_texture", "label": "Grain texture rule", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_navigation", "label": "6-item navigation + Work overlay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_page_activity_toggle", "label": "Page activity toggle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_preloader", "label": "Preloader", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_photography_viewer", "label": "Photography 3-view viewer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_page_transitions", "label": "Page transitions (content-as-animation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_globe", "label": "Exhibition globe", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_page_content_cms", "label": "Page content CMS (3 collections)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three collections (page_settings, page_seo, page_sections), one admin surface at /admin/pages. 'Empty means empty everywhere \u2014 no auto-pick'; the hero's old newest-photo fallback was removed in S4 because it could resolve to a video-file URL rendered through next/image \u2192 a broken frame."}, {"id": "claude_security_rules", "label": "Security rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 2026-07-31 audit found a static non-expiring admin session cookie live since auth was written, plus a plaintext password fallback in production. Both fixed in S1. Standing rules: never invent auth, no NEXT_PUBLIC_ on secrets, constant-time comparison, rate-limit every public route, auth constants in one runtime-agnostic file."}, {"id": "claude_auth_session_token", "label": "session-token.ts (signed 2-day TTL token)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Auth constants live here and it must stay runtime-agnostic (no node:crypto/next-headers/DB) because proxy.ts runs in the Edge runtime and imports it. Tokens are stateless \u2014 TTL is short (2 days) because logout cannot revoke before expiry."}, {"id": "claude_csp", "label": "Content-Security-Policy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_design_tokens", "label": "Design tokens (OKLCH, section-shell, radius)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_reusable_components", "label": "Reusable components \u2014 always use", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_code_quality_rules", "label": "Code quality rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reuse over repetition is the primary rule (not file length). Any code that can become a reusable component must be refactored into one; no big files; no duplicated patterns/logic; no dead code."}, {"id": "claude_testing_ci", "label": "Testing & CI (Vitest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runner is Vitest; never run next build to verify \u2014 chain is tsc --noEmit + eslint (--max-warnings 0) + npm test + dev server. Coverage deliberately minimal: auth pure functions + a server-module import smoke test."}, {"id": "claude_queue_protocol", "label": "Queue protocol (3-gate cycle)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_design_motion_skills", "label": "Design & motion skills routing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_skill_conflicts", "label": "Skill conflicts \u2014 this project wins", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Third-party skills encode their authors' taste; where they conflict with CLAUDE.md, CLAUDE.md wins. Known conflicts: taste-skill bans em-dashes (brand voice prescribes them); Impeccable bans bounce/elastic easing (D5 cursor spring + D4 Dancing wave are deliberate)."}, {"id": "claude_pageheader", "label": "PageHeader.tsx", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"i